        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP 556, Modern Metropolitan Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Metropolitan Cabinet Pull is available in 2 sizes: a 96m and a 128mm. Choose from polished chrome or satin nickel. The Modern Metropolitan Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the installation hardware. It will add a chic sleekness to your kitchen cabinet door and drawers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Metropolitan Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-556:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 9mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 121mm</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 21mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-557:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 128mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 155mm</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 21mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
